WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.567
-With prominent figures
on the right

00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:03.968
embracing and parroting

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:06.234
the dangerous white nationalist
conspiracy theory known

00:00:06.234 --> 00:00:08.501
as the Great Replacement,
it's worth noting that,

00:00:08.501 --> 00:00:10.400
in addition to being
deeply racist,

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.901
bigoted, and dehumanizing,
it's also incredibly stupid.

00:00:12.901 --> 00:00:15.000
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.901
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:18.901 --> 00:00:20.934
You might remember that,
throughout his presidency,

00:00:20.934 --> 00:00:22.734
Donald Trump tried
to fan the flames

00:00:22.734 --> 00:00:24.200
of a racist conspiracy theory

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.868
by claiming that Democrats
were somehow organizing

00:00:26.868 --> 00:00:29.834
caravans of migrants
to cross the Southern border

00:00:29.834 --> 00:00:32.834
for their own political benefit,
and even handing out cash

00:00:32.834 --> 00:00:35.033
to incentivize people
to come to the U.S.

00:00:35.033 --> 00:00:36.701
-This is an invasion!

00:00:36.701 --> 00:00:40.667
I was badly criticized
for using the word invasion.

00:00:40.667 --> 00:00:42.100
It's an invasion.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:44.334
People hate the word invasion,
but that's what it is.

00:00:44.334 --> 00:00:47.367
It's an invasion of drugs
and criminals and people.

00:00:47.367 --> 00:00:51.534
Mexico should step up
and stop this onslaught,

00:00:51.534 --> 00:00:53.667
this invasion into our country.

00:00:53.667 --> 00:00:57.801
The Democrats want
to invite

00:00:57.801 --> 00:00:59.801
caravan after caravan

00:00:59.801 --> 00:01:01.267
[ Booing ]
of illegal aliens

00:01:01.267 --> 00:01:02.934
into our country.

00:01:02.934 --> 00:01:04.501
A large group of people.

00:01:04.501 --> 00:01:06.234
They call it a caravan.

00:01:06.234 --> 00:01:11.634
[ Booing ]

00:01:11.634 --> 00:01:14.667
You know how
the caravan started?

00:01:14.667 --> 00:01:17.801
Does everybody know
what this means?

00:01:17.801 --> 00:01:20.567
I think the Democrats
had something to do with it.

00:01:20.567 --> 00:01:22.334
-What is he doing?
Is that like a game

00:01:22.334 --> 00:01:23.834
of racist charades?

00:01:23.834 --> 00:01:24.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.868 --> 00:01:26.667
Is he dealing invisible cards?

00:01:26.667 --> 00:01:28.934
Which is something I bet
he tried at his casinos

00:01:28.934 --> 00:01:30.667
before they went bankrupt.
[ As Trump ] And that's

00:01:30.667 --> 00:01:33.067
[ Laughter ]
a 6 for you, a 6 for you,
and would you look at that?

00:01:33.067 --> 00:01:34.734
It's another blackjack
for the dealer.

00:01:34.734 --> 00:01:36.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.133 --> 00:01:38.901
To no one's surprise,
the racist caravan hysteria

00:01:38.901 --> 00:01:40.868
had a habit
of conveniently popping up

00:01:40.868 --> 00:01:42.167
during election cycles

00:01:42.167 --> 00:01:44.801
and then quietly receding
when the elections were over

00:01:44.801 --> 00:01:47.167
because it was obviously
just a cynical tool

00:01:47.167 --> 00:01:49.334
to scare people
and stir up Trump's base.

00:01:49.334 --> 00:01:51.534
And, as The New York Times
reported in 2018,

00:01:51.534 --> 00:01:54.000
it clearly had an effect
on Trump's voters.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:54.767
As The Times put it...

00:01:58.501 --> 00:02:00.968
Including a 75-year-old
Republican in Northern Minnesota

00:02:00.968 --> 00:02:03.067
who said she was afraid
that migrant gangs

00:02:03.067 --> 00:02:05.567
could take over people's summer
lake houses in the state.

00:02:05.567 --> 00:02:06.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.200
[ Laughter ]
Now, obviously, that's insane.

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:17.400
If we've learned anything
from movies,

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:18.901
it's that,
if you have a lake house,

00:02:18.901 --> 00:02:21.100
you don't have to be worried
about immigrants.

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:22.400
You have to be worried

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:23.467
about Jason.

00:02:23.467 --> 00:02:24.834
[ Laughter ]
You guys,

00:02:24.834 --> 00:02:26.601
the more you focus
on immigrants,

00:02:26.601 --> 00:02:28.267
the easier it gets for Jason.

00:02:28.267 --> 00:02:30.133
[ Laughter ]
You're pointing your binoculars

00:02:30.133 --> 00:02:32.033
toward the Southern border.
Meanwhile, Jason's

00:02:32.033 --> 00:02:35.234
just licking his lips,
strolling into your tool shed,

00:02:35.234 --> 00:02:36.501
waiting for night to fall.

00:02:36.501 --> 00:02:39.067
[ Laughter ]
Picking out one of your tools.

00:02:39.067 --> 00:02:40.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.801 --> 00:02:42.868
Now, it should be easy
for a healthy political party

00:02:42.868 --> 00:02:44.000
in a healthy political system

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.534
to condemn white nationalism,

00:02:45.534 --> 00:02:48.467
as well as the dangerous
and deeply racist

00:02:48.467 --> 00:02:49.868
replacement theory
that comes with it

00:02:49.868 --> 00:02:51.734
and, yet, of course,
there are prominent figures

00:02:51.734 --> 00:02:54.567
on the right who insist,
while spreading it themselves,

00:02:54.567 --> 00:02:55.968
that it doesn't even exist.

00:02:55.968 --> 00:02:58.901
-Where, exactly, is all this
criminal white supremacy,

00:02:58.901 --> 00:03:01.434
this right-wing domestic
terrorism that poses,

00:03:01.434 --> 00:03:05.234
"the most lethal terrorist
threat in the homeland"?

00:03:05.234 --> 00:03:07.434
Where is it? Well, of course,
it doesn't exist.

00:03:07.434 --> 00:03:09.834
If you were to assemble a list,

00:03:09.834 --> 00:03:11.567
a hierarchy of concerns,

00:03:11.567 --> 00:03:13.067
the problems,
this country faces,

00:03:13.067 --> 00:03:15.033
where would white supremacy be
on the list?

00:03:15.033 --> 00:03:17.167
Right up there with Russia,
probably.

00:03:17.167 --> 00:03:20.000
It's actually not
a real problem in America.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.701
The combined membership of every
white supremacist organization

00:03:22.701 --> 00:03:24.267
in this country
would be able to fit

00:03:24.267 --> 00:03:26.033
inside a college
football stadium.

00:03:26.033 --> 00:03:27.567
"White supremacy,
that's the problem."

00:03:27.567 --> 00:03:28.667
This is a hoax.

00:03:28.667 --> 00:03:29.767
-First of all,
you don't have to be

00:03:29.767 --> 00:03:30.868
a card-carrying member

00:03:30.868 --> 00:03:32.467
of a white supremacist
organization

00:03:32.467 --> 00:03:33.667
to be a white supremacist.

00:03:33.667 --> 00:03:34.834
It's not Costco.

00:03:34.834 --> 00:03:37.200
[ Laughter ]
You can be a white supremacist

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:38.667
without being
an official member,

00:03:38.667 --> 00:03:40.067
the same way
you can watch movies

00:03:40.067 --> 00:03:41.367
without having
a Blockbuster card.

00:03:41.367 --> 00:03:43.167
Although, personally,
I'd give anything

00:03:43.167 --> 00:03:44.434
for Blockbuster to come back.

00:03:44.434 --> 00:03:46.667
No more sitting in front
of the Netflix home screen,

00:03:46.667 --> 00:03:47.868
scrolling for something
to watch.

00:03:47.868 --> 00:03:49.901
Back home,
when we had Blockbuster,

00:03:49.901 --> 00:03:51.767
I just waited for Mom
to get back from work

00:03:51.767 --> 00:03:53.367
and say,
"I got 'Fried Green Tomatoes.'"

00:03:53.367 --> 00:03:54.801
[ Laughter ]
And then you'd say,

00:03:54.801 --> 00:03:56.133
"I don't think I'm going
to like it, Mom."

00:03:56.133 --> 00:03:57.334
And then your dad would say,

00:03:57.334 --> 00:03:59.200
"Well, then you can go stare
at the wall!"

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:00.734
[ Laughter ]
So you'd watch it.

00:04:00.734 --> 00:04:02.000
And you know what?
I did like it.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:03.000
I liked it a lot.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.133
Thanks, Blockbuster.

00:04:04.133 --> 00:04:05.834
Anyway, can we go back
to this part?

00:04:05.834 --> 00:04:07.100
-The combined membership
of every

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:09.467
white supremacist organization
in this country

00:04:09.467 --> 00:04:11.868
would be able to fit inside
a college football stadium.

00:04:11.868 --> 00:04:13.601
-First of all,
a college football stadium

00:04:13.601 --> 00:04:17.534
could fit like 100,000 people,
which is a ton of people.

00:04:17.534 --> 00:04:18.801
[ Laughter ]
If I told you, "Don't worry,

00:04:18.801 --> 00:04:20.868
I rounded up
all the white supremacists,"

00:04:20.868 --> 00:04:22.100
and walked you into here,

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:24.400
I don't think your reaction
would be, "Phew!"

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.767
[ Laughter ]

00:04:26.767 --> 00:04:28.901
Have you ever watched
a college football game,

00:04:28.901 --> 00:04:30.901
or do you just stand outside the
glass at the country club,

00:04:30.901 --> 00:04:32.434
watching your rich pals
play squash

00:04:32.434 --> 00:04:34.167
with that look on your face,
like you just got to Earth

00:04:34.167 --> 00:04:36.167
and you're trying
to understand human behavior?

00:04:36.167 --> 00:04:39.400
[ Laughter ]
Second, why don't you just do
some journalism and find out?

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:42.033
It's easy to just ask
open-ended questions

00:04:42.033 --> 00:04:44.200
without answering them.
Anyone can do that.

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:45.767
This dude's like a search engine

00:04:45.767 --> 00:04:48.767
that just answers your questions
with a series of more questions.

00:04:48.767 --> 00:04:50.534
He's...

00:04:50.534 --> 00:04:51.701
[ Laughter ]

00:04:54.367 --> 00:04:55.467
[ As Carlson ]
I have a question for you.

00:04:55.467 --> 00:04:57.067
How big is the cup

00:04:57.067 --> 00:04:59.367
and why are the cups
all different sizes?

00:04:59.367 --> 00:05:00.868
Why is the government trying
to control you

00:05:00.868 --> 00:05:02.400
