00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:04.234
[ Laughter ]
you're allowed to have
in one cup?

00:05:04.234 --> 00:05:06.234
And, if you're only allowed
to have eight ounces in a cup,

00:05:06.234 --> 00:05:08.334
then where are all
the other ounces going?

00:05:08.334 --> 00:05:10.200
[ Laughter ]
Are they being stolen
by a secret cabal

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:13.200
of woke elites who are hoarding
all the ounces for themselves

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:15.100
[ Laughter ]
while threatening to cancel you

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:16.434
for daring to question
their authority?

00:05:16.434 --> 00:05:18.000
When you ask the barista
at Starbucks

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.834
to pour 1,000 ounces of coffee
into your cup,

00:05:20.834 --> 00:05:22.300
[ Laughter ]
will they say
that's not possible?

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:24.234
When you climb over the counter
and claim it

00:05:24.234 --> 00:05:25.467
your constitutional right

00:05:25.467 --> 00:05:27.267
to take as many biscotti
as you want,

00:05:27.267 --> 00:05:30.067
[ Laughter ]
will they have you arrested
by the thought police

00:05:30.067 --> 00:05:31.934
and put you in a muzzle,
like Hannibal Lecter,

00:05:31.934 --> 00:05:34.767
to shut you up because you're
being "annoying as [bleep]"?

00:05:34.767 --> 00:05:36.234
[ Laughter ]
Will that happen to you,

00:05:36.234 --> 00:05:38.367
just like it happened
to me yesterday?!

00:05:38.367 --> 00:05:39.968
[ Laughter ]

00:05:39.968 --> 00:05:42.334
[ Cheering and applause ]
But, of course,
he wants to pretend --

00:05:42.334 --> 00:05:44.367
he wants to pretend
it's not a problem

00:05:44.367 --> 00:05:47.000
because he's also openly
and repeatedly

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:49.033
promoted replacement theory
on his show.

00:05:49.033 --> 00:05:51.667
-An unrelenting stream
of immigration, but why?

00:05:51.667 --> 00:05:53.667
Well, Joe Biden just said it --

00:05:53.667 --> 00:05:55.868
to change the racial mix
of the country.

00:05:55.868 --> 00:05:57.968
That's the reason.
To reduce the political power

00:05:57.968 --> 00:05:59.934
of people whose ancestors
lived here,

00:05:59.934 --> 00:06:02.434
and dramatically increase
the proportion of Americans

00:06:02.434 --> 00:06:04.200
newly arrived
from the Third World.

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:06.934
In political terms, this policy
is called the Great Replacement,

00:06:06.934 --> 00:06:08.467
the replacement
of legacy Americans

00:06:08.467 --> 00:06:10.801
with more obedient people
from faraway countries.

00:06:10.801 --> 00:06:12.968
Now, I know that the left

00:06:12.968 --> 00:06:14.434
and all the little gatekeepers
on Twitter

00:06:14.434 --> 00:06:18.534
become literally hysterical,
if you use the term replacement,

00:06:18.534 --> 00:06:20.667
if you suggest
that the Democratic Party

00:06:20.667 --> 00:06:23.834
is trying to replace
the current electorate,

00:06:23.834 --> 00:06:26.667
the voters now casting ballots,
with new people,

00:06:26.667 --> 00:06:28.901
more obedient voters,
from the Third World.

00:06:28.901 --> 00:06:30.434
But they become hysterical
because that's --

00:06:30.434 --> 00:06:32.033
that's what's happening,
actually.

00:06:32.033 --> 00:06:33.534
-Mm.
-Let's just say it --
that's true.

00:06:33.534 --> 00:06:34.868
In other words,
you're being replaced

00:06:34.868 --> 00:06:36.934
and there's nothing you can do
about it, so shut up!

00:06:36.934 --> 00:06:38.667
[ Laughs ]

00:06:38.667 --> 00:06:39.601
-[ Laughter ]

00:06:39.601 --> 00:06:41.367
-Truly a haunting laugh.

00:06:41.367 --> 00:06:43.634
[ Laughter ]
I love the audacity

00:06:43.634 --> 00:06:46.100
of calling people on the left
literally hysterical

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:47.501
and then ending one
of your rants

00:06:47.501 --> 00:06:49.367
with an insane terror giggle.

00:06:49.367 --> 00:06:50.567
[ Laughter ]

00:06:50.567 --> 00:06:51.601
[ As Carlson ]
[ High-pitched laugh ]

00:06:51.601 --> 00:06:54.200
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:57.000
Second, and more important,
the so-called replacement theory

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:59.400
is obviously racist,
dangerous, and dehumanizing,

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:01.367
but on top of everything else,
it's also incredibly stupid.

00:07:01.367 --> 00:07:03.334
I mean, just think about it
for like half a second.

00:07:03.334 --> 00:07:04.334
No one's being replaced.

00:07:04.334 --> 00:07:06.267
There's no capacity limit here.

00:07:06.267 --> 00:07:07.901
It's not like there's a bouncer

00:07:07.901 --> 00:07:10.567
who only lets two in
when two leave, and yet,

00:07:10.567 --> 00:07:13.300
that same bouncer somehow keeps
letting in girls and cool dudes,

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:14.734
even though you
and your friend Todd have been

00:07:14.734 --> 00:07:16.434
at the front of the line
for like half an hour.

00:07:16.434 --> 00:07:17.767
[ Laughter ]
So, finally, you say,

00:07:17.767 --> 00:07:21.133
"Hey, man, you either let us in,
or we're going to FGT!"

00:07:21.133 --> 00:07:22.968
And he says,
"What does FGT mean?"

00:07:22.968 --> 00:07:25.634
And you say, "Go home and watch
'Fried Green Tomatoes.'"

00:07:25.634 --> 00:07:26.934
[ Laughter ]
Then he says, "Oh, man.

00:07:26.934 --> 00:07:28.234
Now, I'm never letting you in.

00:07:28.234 --> 00:07:29.801
Again, though, just think

00:07:29.801 --> 00:07:31.901
about how breathtakingly dumb
the logic here is.

00:07:31.901 --> 00:07:33.200
No one gets replaced

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:34.701
when another person
enters the country.

00:07:34.701 --> 00:07:36.467
The government doesn't come
knocking on your door and say,

00:07:36.467 --> 00:07:37.734
"Hey, someone just
crossed the border,

00:07:37.734 --> 00:07:39.300
so now you have to move
to a different country.

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:40.734
We're super sorry.
Pack your [bleep] up.

00:07:40.734 --> 00:07:41.801
You're moving to Sweden.

00:07:41.801 --> 00:07:43.567
Here's a troll
and a pair of clogs."

00:07:43.567 --> 00:07:44.968
[ Laughter ]
Second,

00:07:44.968 --> 00:07:46.634
just think about how dumb
and dehumanizing it is

00:07:46.634 --> 00:07:48.934
to call migrants who are fleeing
poverty and violence

00:07:48.934 --> 00:07:51.167
and coming here to seek
a better life obedient.

00:07:51.167 --> 00:07:52.367
They're doing one
of the most difficult things

00:07:52.367 --> 00:07:54.300
a human being can do --
uprooting themselves

00:07:54.300 --> 00:07:55.601
and their families,
leaving their homes,

00:07:55.601 --> 00:07:57.868
and making a dangerous trek
to a foreign country,

00:07:57.868 --> 00:07:59.934
and they're doing it
at great personal cost,

00:07:59.934 --> 00:08:01.667
in the hopes
of seeking a better life.

00:08:01.667 --> 00:08:03.501
For this theory to make
any sense at all,

00:08:03.501 --> 00:08:05.234
you'd have to believe
that all those people

00:08:05.234 --> 00:08:07.100
are just sitting at home
waiting for a call

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:08.801
from the
Democratic National Committee,

00:08:08.801 --> 00:08:10.300
telling them it's time
to join the caravan

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:11.467
and make the trek
toward America.

00:08:11.467 --> 00:08:13.167
"Alright, everybody,
pack up your stuff.

00:08:13.167 --> 00:08:14.467
I just got the call
from Joe Biden.

00:08:14.467 --> 00:08:17.834
We're replacing the Hendersons
and good news --

00:08:17.834 --> 00:08:19.400
[ Laughter ]
we're getting their
Blockbuster membership.

00:08:19.400 --> 00:08:20.701
[ Laughter ]

00:08:20.701 --> 00:08:22.868
Prominent figures on the right
have been parroting

00:08:22.868 --> 00:08:25.801
this depraved and deeply racist
ideology for years, now,

00:08:25.801 --> 00:08:28.734
and, on top of being bigoted,
dehumanizing, and dangerous,

00:08:28.734 --> 00:08:30.167
it's also just
breathtakingly dumb.

00:08:30.167 --> 00:08:33.234
It's so dumb, even they can't
actually explain the logic.

00:08:33.234 --> 00:08:35.434
They just toss out
racist bull[bleep] and say...

00:08:35.434 --> 00:08:37.634
-Does everybody know
what this means?

00:08:37.634 --> 00:08:39.234
-This has been "A Closer Look."

